<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Telecom hits all-time high of 5,530 esc.</title>
<headline>Portugal Telecom hits all-time high of 5,530 esc.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Portugal Telecom hit an all-time high of 5,530 escudos in trade on the Lisbon bourse after breaking through resistance of 5,500 escudos, dealers said.  </p>
<p>&quot;PT seems to be on the way up still and is consolidating at each new high,&quot; said an operator who asked not to be identified.</p>
<p>The PSI-20 index of 20 leading shares, which includes PT, has risen by 11 percent so far this year.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
